Set Width 1440
Set Height 640
Source docs/demo/common.tape

Hide
Type "export PATH=/tmp/nessie-demo/bin:/usr/bin:/bin; PS1='$ '; set -o pipefail; cd /tmp/nessie-demo; clear"
Enter
Show

Type "nessie scan this.nessus"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "nessie items --min-severity medium this.nessus"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 4.5s
Hide
